{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108361","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108361/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108361/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108361/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108361","id":3207168827,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6_KYM7","number":108361,"title":"Modifying JSON files in Godot 4.4.1-stable does not save the file as it is written.","user":{"login":"DavidThePurple","id":59494766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDk0NzY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59494766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidThePurple","html_url":"https://github.com/DavidThePurple","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidThePurple/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidThePurple/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidThePurple/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidThePurple/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidThePurple/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidThePurple/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidThePurple/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidThePurple/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidThePurple/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-07-06T23:52:18Z","updated_at":"2025-07-07T14:25:07Z","closed_at":"2025-07-07T14:25:03Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4.1.stable.mono\n\n### System information\n\nLinux Mint (Cinnamon, latest stable) - Forward+ - 4090\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe following behavoir is unexpected from the Godot editor when working with JSON files. If a user saves a file, the contents should match exactly what they saw upon saving. In no universe is it acceptable for the data to be repopulated without some form of feedback explaining it happened. \n\nWhen editing JSON files in the Godot editor, the actual contents and formatting are not respected. \nSaving a blank file after clearing its contents leaves junk data from the previous save. \nGodot Editor reports a save, after clearing data, and in Godot Editor it appears clear, but in any other text editor or command line (i.e. cat filename.json) the file is not cleared, and is in-fact populated with the previous save's text, but with additional formatting (newlines etc). \n\nThis becomes problematic when troubleshooting writing to JSON files from the editor (in this case, building a custom dialogue system). \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n### Step 1\nI created the json file in Godot. Below is the contents.\n\n```\n{\"foo\":\"bar\"}\n```\n\n### Step 2\nI deleted all the contents of the file and tried to save an empty json file.\n\n### Step 3\nI check the file contents and it was populated with the garbage I tried to delete, with additional text formatting.\n\n```\n% cat myfile.json\n{\n    \"foo\": \"bar\"\n}\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n./","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108361/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108361/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}